Machine Learning-Based Bias Correction
After the initial model selection process, four models, namely decision tree, random forest,
gradient boosting, and LightGBM,5–8 were further optimized through Bayesian hyperparam
eter tuning. The detailed parameter ranges for each model are presented in Tables S1−S4.
Bayesian optimization focused on minimizing the mean squared error, ensuring optimal per
formance for continuous target prediction.9,10
